features.description:
There's an error when trying to start the project using `npm run start` :

[Nest] 50184  - 10/07/2025, 1:30:36 PM   ERROR [ExceptionHandler] Nest can't resolve dependencies of the AdminService (Symbol(USER_PROFILES_REPOSITORY), Symbol(CONVERSATION_LOGS_REPOSITORY), Symbol(ACTIVITY_LOGS_REPOSITORY), MoodsService, ?, S3StorageService). Please make sure that the argument Symbol(JOURNALS_REPOSITORY) at index [4] is available in the AdminModule context.

Potential solutions:
- Is AdminModule a valid NestJS module?
- If Symbol(JOURNALS_REPOSITORY) is a provider, is it part of the current AdminModule?
- If Symbol(JOURNALS_REPOSITORY) is exported from a separate @Module, is that module imported within AdminModule?
  @Module({
    imports: [ /* the Module containing Symbol(JOURNALS_REPOSITORY) */ ]
  })
